<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>GreenTech Institute (GIBS) — WordPress Case Study · Sazzad Hossain</title>
<meta name="description" content="A long-established Chittagong institute with British affiliations gets a new digital campus: website, media archive, downloads and a Moodle LMS in one place.">
<meta name="author" content="Sazzad Hossain (@developersazzad)">
<style>
@font-face{font-family:'SG';src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,) format('woff2');font-weight:500;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:'SG';src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,) format('woff2');font-weight:700;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:'IN';src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,) format('woff2');font-weight:400;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:'IN';src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,) format('woff2');font-weight:600;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:'IN';src:local('Inter');font-weight:700}
:root{
  --bg:#060a07; --bg2:#0c160e; --accent:#43d63a; --accent2:#f3e23a; --ink:#effbef;
  --muted:color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 62%, transparent);
  --line:color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 12%, transparent);
  --card:color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 5%, transparent);
  --radius:18px;
  --display:'SG','Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --body:'IN','Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;overflow-x:clip}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);line-height:1.6;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
img{display:block;max-width:100%}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.bg-fx{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;
  background:
   radial-gradient(900px 600px at 85% -10%, color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 22%, transparent), transparent 60%),
   radial-gradient(700px 500px at -10% 40%, color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent2) 14%, transparent), transparent 60%),
   linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),var(--bg2));}
.bg-fx::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.35;
  background-image:linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:64px 64px;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%,#000 20%,transparent 70%)}
.wrap{width:min(1200px,92vw);margin:0 auto}

/* ── top bar ── */
.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;backdrop-filter:blur(14px);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 70%,transparent);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.topbar .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:64px;gap:20px}
.brand{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.brand .dot{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;color:#fff;transform:rotate(-8deg)}
.brand em{font-style:normal;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
.topbar nav{display:flex;gap:26px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.topbar nav a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.btn,.btn-sm{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s,background .25s}
.btn-sm{padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card)}
.btn-sm:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.btn{padding:14px 24px;font-size:15px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 30px -10px var(--accent)}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px -12px var(--accent)}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:none;color:var(--ink)}
.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}

/* ── hero / section 1 ── */
.hero{padding:70px 0 90px}
.hero .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px}
.eyebrow span{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}
.eyebrow span:first-child{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 18%,transparent);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 45%,transparent);color:var(--ink)}
h1{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(46px,6.4vw,88px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:700}
h1 span{background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.lead{font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px);color:var(--muted);margin:22px 0 30px;max-width:560px}
.meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:22px}
.meta div{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 88%,var(--ink));padding:12px 14px}
.meta dt{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--muted)}
.meta dd{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:30px}
.chip{font-size:12.5px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}

/* ── 3D scene ── */
.scene-wrap{position:relative;height:600px}
.scene{position:absolute;inset:0;perspective:1600px;perspective-origin:50% 40%}
.stage{position:absolute;inset:0;transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:rotateX(var(--rx,10deg)) rotateY(var(--ry,-16deg));transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.floor{position:absolute;left:-20%;right:-20%;bottom:-40px;height:420px;transform:rotateX(90deg) translateZ(-180px);transform-origin:bottom;
  background-image:linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 50%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 50%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:48px 48px;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 100%,#000 10%,transparent 65%);opacity:.55;animation:floor 6s linear infinite}
@keyframes floor{to{background-position:0 48px}}
.browser{position:absolute;left:2%;top:40px;width:520px;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;transform:translateZ(0);
  box-shadow:0 60px 80px -40px rgba(0,0,0,.8),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08),0 0 90px -20px color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 60%,transparent)}
.browser .bar{height:34px;background:#101218;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:0 12px}
.browser .bar i{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff5f57}
.browser .bar i:nth-child(2){background:#febc2e}.browser .bar i:nth-child(3){background:#28c840}
.browser .bar span{margin-left:12px;flex:1;font-size:11px;color:#9aa0b4;background:#1b1e27;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-family:var(--body)}
.browser .vp{height:340px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.browser .vp img{width:100%;animation:autoscroll 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
@keyframes autoscroll{0%,8%{transform:translateY(0)}92%,100%{transform:translateY(var(--scroll,-60%))}}
.phone{position:absolute;right:4%;top:170px;width:190px;padding:9px;border-radius:32px;background:#0b0c10;transform:translateZ(120px) rotateY(-6deg);
  box-shadow:0 50px 70px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.9),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.12),inset 0 0 0 2px #222}
.phone img{border-radius:24px;width:100%;height:370px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top}
.phone .notch{position:absolute;top:14px;left:50%;width:62px;height:16px;margin-left:-31px;background:#0b0c10;border-radius:10px;z-index:2}
.cube{position:absolute;right:16%;top:0;width:86px;height:86px;transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:translateZ(60px);animation:spin 14s linear infinite}
.cube .f{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:17px;color:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 85%,transparent),color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent2) 55%,transparent));backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.cube .f1{transform:translateZ(43px)}.cube .f2{transform:rotateY(180deg) translateZ(43px)}
.cube .f3{transform:rotateY(90deg) translateZ(43px)}.cube .f4{transform:rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(43px)}
.cube .f5{transform:rotateX(90deg) translateZ(43px)}.cube .f6{transform:rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(43px)}
@keyframes spin{from{transform:translateZ(60px) rotateX(-20deg) rotateY(0)}to{transform:translateZ(60px) rotateX(-20deg) rotateY(360deg)}}
.orbit{position:absolute;left:8%;bottom:30px;width:180px;height:180px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent2) 70%,transparent);
  transform:translateZ(160px) rotateX(70deg);box-shadow:0 0 40px -6px var(--accent2);animation:orbit 8s linear infinite}
.orbit::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:-7px;left:50%;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent2);box-shadow:0 0 20px var(--accent2)}
@keyframes orbit{to{transform:translateZ(160px) rotateX(70deg) rotateZ(360deg)}}
.tag3d{position:absolute;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;
  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 70%,transparent);border:1px solid var(--line);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);box-shadow:0 20px 40px -20px #000}
.tag3d::before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);margin-right:8px;box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--accent)}
.tag3d.t1{left:-2%;top:400px;transform:translateZ(200px);animation:bob 5s ease-in-out infinite}
.tag3d.t2{right:0;top:84px;transform:translateZ(180px);animation:bob 6s ease-in-out -2s infinite}
@keyframes bob{50%{margin-top:-14px}}

/* ── sections ── */
.sec{padding:100px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative}
.sec-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:10px 28px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:56px}
.sec-head .num{font-family:var(--display);font-size:92px;line-height:.8;font-weight:700;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 80%,transparent);grid-row:span 2}
.sec-head .kicker{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}
.sec-head h2{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,48px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em}
.sec-head p{grid-column:2;color:var(--muted);max-width:760px;font-size:17px;margin-top:8px}

.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:70px}
.problems h3,.builds-title{font-family:var(--display);font-size:22px;margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.problems h3::before,.builds-title::before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:var(--accent)}
.problems ol{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:12px}
.problems li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:36px 1fr;gap:14px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);transition:border-color .3s,transform .3s}
.problems li:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 60%,transparent);transform:translateX(6px)}
.problems li b{display:block;font-size:15.5px;margin-bottom:2px}
.problems li p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.problems .pi{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 14%,transparent)}

/* 3D card stack */
.stack{position:relative}
.stack-stage{position:relative;height:430px;perspective:1400px}
.scard{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:40px;margin:auto;width:92%;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;
  transform-origin:50% 100%;transition:transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),opacity .8s,filter .8s;box-shadow:0 40px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.85),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.scard img{width:100%;height:330px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top}
.scard .cap{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px}
.stack-info{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
.stack-info h4{font-family:var(--display);font-size:20px}
.stack-info p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);min-height:44px}
.dots{display:flex;gap:8px}
.dots button{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:.3s}
.dots button.on{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}

.build-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;perspective:1200px}
.bcard{position:relative;padding:26px;border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(160deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 7%,transparent),transparent 60%);
  transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .2s ease-out,border-color .3s;overflow:hidden}
.bcard:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 55%,transparent)}
.bcard::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(400px circle at var(--mx,50%) var(--my,0%),color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 16%,transparent),transparent 45%);opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s;pointer-events:none}
.bcard:hover::after{opacity:1}
.bcard .n{font-family:var(--display);font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;transform:translateZ(30px)}
.bcard h4{font-family:var(--display);font-size:20px;margin:10px 0 8px;transform:translateZ(40px)}
.bcard p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);transform:translateZ(20px)}
.bcard .t{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;font-size:11.5px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}

/* impact */
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;margin-bottom:60px}
.stat{padding:28px 24px;border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.stat::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2))}
.stat b{font-family:var(--display);font-size:56px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.03em;display:block}
.stat b i{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}
.stat>span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.impact-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}
.outcomes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.oc{padding:22px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.oc b{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:6px}
.oc b::before{content:"✓";width:22px;height:22px;flex:none;border-radius:6px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.oc p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.ring-wrap{position:relative;height:380px;perspective:1000px;display:grid;place-items:center}
.ring3d{position:absolute;width:10px;height:10px;transform-style:preserve-3d;animation:ring 26s linear infinite}
@keyframes ring{from{transform:rotateX(-14deg) rotateY(0)}to{transform:rotateX(-14deg) rotateY(360deg)}}
.ring3d .rc{position:absolute;left:-70px;top:-18px;width:140px;padding:8px 0;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;border-radius:10px;
  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 60%,var(--accent) 16%);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 50%,transparent)}
.ring-core{position:relative;width:150px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:15px;line-height:1.2;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 90%,#fff),var(--accent) 45%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 40%,#000));color:#fff;
  box-shadow:0 0 80px -10px var(--accent),inset -10px -14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.closing{margin-top:70px;padding:44px;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:30px;
  background:linear-gradient(120deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 20%,transparent),color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent2) 8%,transparent))}
.closing p{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.015em;max-width:760px}
.closing p b{color:var(--accent2)}

/* credit */
.credit{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:50px 0 60px}
.credit .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.dev{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.dev .av{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:16px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));transform:rotate(-6deg)}
.dev small{display:block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.dev b{font-family:var(--display);font-size:22px}
.dev span{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.socials{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.socials a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);transition:.25s}
.socials a:hover{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.socials svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:currentColor}
.copy{width:100%;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:26px}

/* reveal */
.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity .9s ease,transform .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

/* responsive */
@media (max-width:1020px){
  .hero .wrap,.split,.impact-split{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .scene-wrap{height:560px;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;width:100%;overflow:hidden;border-radius:24px}
  .build-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .topbar nav{display:none}
}
@media (max-width:640px){
  .scene-wrap{height:420px}
  .stage{scale:.66;transform-origin:30% 20%}
  .meta{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .build-grid,.outcomes{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .sec-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sec-head .num{font-size:64px;grid-row:auto}.sec-head p{grid-column:1}
  .stack-stage{height:320px}.scard img{height:230px}
  .stat b{font-size:42px}
  .closing{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.rv{opacity:1;transform:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg-fx"></div>

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="#overview"><span class="dot">SH</span>Sazzad Hossain <em>/ Case Study 03</em></a>
    <nav><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#build">Challenge &amp; Build</a><a href="#impact">Impact</a></nav>
    <a class="btn-sm" href="https://gibsbd.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Live site ↗</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ═════════════ SECTION 1 · OVERVIEW ═════════════ -->
<section id="overview" class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy rv">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span>Case Study 03</span><span>WordPress</span><span>Institute + Moodle LMS</span></div>
      <h1>Green<span>Tech</span> GIBS</h1>
      <p class="lead">A long-established Chittagong institute with British affiliations gets a new digital campus: website, media archive, downloads and a Moodle LMS in one place.</p>
      <dl class="meta"><div><dt>Client</dt><dd>UK Professor · Chairman, GIBS</dd></div><div><dt>Industry</dt><dd>Higher Education · Bangladesh</dd></div><div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>WordPress + Moodle LMS</dd></div><div><dt>Theme</dt><dd>Astra + Elementor Pro</dd></div><div><dt>Launched</dt><dd>2024</dd></div><div><dt>My Role</dt><dd>Migration, Build &amp; LMS Integration</dd></div></dl>
      <div class="chips"><span class="chip">WordPress</span><span class="chip">Astra</span><span class="chip">Elementor Pro</span><span class="chip">Slider Revolution</span><span class="chip">WPForms</span><span class="chip">Moodle LMS</span><span class="chip">YouTube Embeds</span><span class="chip">Lightbox Galleries</span></div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn" href="https://gibsbd.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit live site ↗</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="#build">See the build ↓</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scene-wrap rv" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="scene" id="scene">
        <div class="stage" id="stage">
          <div class="floor"></div>
          <div class="browser"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>🔒 gibsbd.org</span></div><div class="vp" id="vp"><img id="fullimg" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="GreenTech Institute (GIBS) full page"></div></div>
          <div class="phone"><div class="notch"></div><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="GreenTech Institute (GIBS) mobile"></div>
          <div class="cube"><div class="f f1">GIBS</div><div class="f f2">WP</div><div class="f f3">GIBS</div><div class="f f4">WP</div><div class="f f5"></div><div class="f f6"></div></div>
          <div class="orbit"></div>
          <div class="tag3d t1">WordPress + Moodle</div>
          <div class="tag3d t2">13-slide course hero</div>
